<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 28.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali to address parliament on Saturday.</p>
<p>- Parliament on Friday passed the 1997 budget.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia-Spain friendship, brotherhood and cooperation treaty, signed in 1995, ratified by the Spanish parliament.</p>
